{
  "info": {
    "name": "DOS Worker API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Worker chunk API (phase 3). Workers publish port 8080 on host ports 8081-8099; find one with `docker compose port --index 1 worker 8080` and set baseUrl. Workers store no checksums: GET returns the bytes as stored, without X-Chunk-Checksum. Chunks PUT here belong to no object, so the controller marks them ORPHAN."
  },
